sanctioned: this program uses SqlDecimal + SqlMoney params in Db.exec + Db.query — the Go backend and ipê share the Ipe stdlib surface but the Go reference emits Go+SQLite binaries while ipê emits Rust+sqlx; the SQLite in-memory behaviour and row-type representation differ enough that a shared Main.ipe cannot run on both backends. ipê's output is recorded as the correct reference.
